# 编译时注入的默认番茄服务器地址和密码（同安卓版 local.properties）。
# Build-time default Tomato server URL and password (same local.properties as the Android app).
local.properties

# Per-machine task handoff ledger; protocol lives in docs/HANDOFF.md
/docs/HANDOFF.local.md

# 内部计划、审查与验收记录；不随产品交付。
# Internal plans, reviews and acceptance records are not product deliverables.
/docs/local/

# Per-machine IDE config (absolute toolchain paths, serial port)
.vscode/

# ESP-IDF specific build outputs
*.bin
!main/assets/*.bin
# TF 卡模板：词库要随仓库发布；书、壁纸、升级固件只在本机放，不提交（固件可能带内置服务器）。
# TF card template: ship the lexicon; never commit books, wallpapers or upgrade firmware (it may carry the built-in server).
!sdcard/ime/pinyin-v1.bin
sdcard/books/*
!sdcard/books/.gitkeep
sdcard/comics/*
!sdcard/comics/.gitkeep
sdcard/wallpapers/*
!sdcard/wallpapers/.gitkeep
sdcard/update/*
!sdcard/update/.gitkeep
*.elf
*.map
flasher_args.json # Generated in build directory
sdkconfig.old
sdkconfig

